  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3210.01 General Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3210.01 General Requirements.\n\n(a) The owners, operators, and the AAR of a NOx budget source shall comply with the monitoring and reporting requirements as provided in this part and in 40 CFR 75, Subpart H.\n\n(b) For purposes of complying with the requirements of (a) above, the definitions in 40 CFR 72.2 and 40 CFR 75 shall apply, except that:\n\n(1) The term “affected unit” shall be replaced with the term “budget source” as defined in Env-A 3203.17; and\n\n(2) The term “designated representative” shall be replaced with the term “AAR” as defined in Env-A 3203.12.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3200.html"
